 "fp_ads_payload": "# \u0110\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o theo bi\u00ean g\u1ed9p \u2014 P&L th\u00e1ng 10/2026\n\n**\u0110\u1ec0 XU\u1ea4T \u2014 agent kh\u00f4ng chi ti\u1ec1n, kh\u00f4ng b\u1eadt voucher, kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ed5i gi\u00e1, kh\u00f4ng c\u00e0i ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng; qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd MXH c\u00e0i tay sau khi duy\u1ec7t.**\n\nNg\u01b0\u1ee1ng bi\u00ean g\u1ed9p t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 30.0%; ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch = l\u00e3i g\u1ed9p th\u00e1ng tham chi\u1ebfu \u00d7 0.2 (GI\u1ea2 \u0110\u1ecaNH `data/fpa_config.json` \u2014 ch\u1edd G\u0110 t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh ch\u1ed1t).\n\n| SKU | K\u00eanh | Bi\u00ean g\u1ed9p | L\u00e3i g\u1ed9p | Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t | M\u00e3 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `da-an-sam-30v` | shopee | \u2014 | \u2014 | 0\u0111 | CHAN_XNQC |\n| `mat-ong-sam-300ml` | shopee | 55.7% | 999.800\u0111 | 199.960\u0111 | DE_XUAT |\n| `sapentol-30v` | shopee | 60.2% | 714.560\u0111 | 0\u0111 | CHAN_XNQC |\n| `saphraton-20v` | shopee | 41.7% | 748.751\u0111 | 0\u0111 | CHAN_XNQC |\n| `saphraton-80v` | shopee | \u2014 | \u2014 | 0\u0111 | CHAN_XNQC |\n| `saphraton-combo-2x20v` | shopee | \u2014 | \u2014 | 0\u0111 | CHAN_XNQC |\n| `savigout-30v` | shopee | 49.6% | 871.380\u0111 | 0\u0111 | CHAN_XNQC |\n| `savina-12v` | shopee | 55.8% | 621.289\u0111 | 124.258\u0111 | DE_XUAT |\n\n- 5 c\u1eb7p SKU \u00d7 k\u00eanh (5 SKU) readiness CAM \u2014 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch 0 (kh\u00f4ng li\u1ec7t k\u00ea t\u00ean).\n- CHAN_XNQC: TPBVSK ch\u01b0a c\u00f3 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn n\u1ed9i dung qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u2014 0.\n- CHO_DU_LIEU: thi\u1ebfu gi\u00e1 v\u1ed1n duy\u1ec7t ho\u1eb7c ch\u01b0a c\u00f3 doanh thu th\u00e1ng tham chi\u1ebfu \u2014 kh\u00f4ng t\u00ednh.\n- T\u1ed5ng ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t: 324.218\u0111.\n"
